\begin_body

\begin_layout Title
Code to compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 and detect K-unstability
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $P\subset\mathbb{R}^{n}$
\end_inset

 be a lattice polytope which is defined by 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
P=\left\{ x\in\mathbb{R}^{n}\mid\left\langle x,n_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}\ge0,\ \forall1\le i\le d\right\} ,
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $n_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

 are primitive vectors and 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}$
\end_inset

.
 Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

 be the lattice measure on the boundary 
\begin_inset Formula $\partial P$
\end_inset

,
 which is defined as follows.
 Consider a facet of 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
F_{i}=\left\{ x\in P\mid\left\langle x,n_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}=0\right\} .
\]

\end_inset

Define 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathrm{d}\sigma|_{F_{i}}=\frac{\mathrm{d}s}{\left|n_{i}\right|}
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}s$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean surface measure on 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\left|n_{i}\right|$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean 
\begin_inset Formula $2$
\end_inset

-norm.
 Another way to define 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

:
 it is the Lebesgue measure on the affine space spanned by 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

 which is normalized by the rank 
\begin_inset Formula $n-1$
\end_inset

 lattice 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}\cap\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The relative DF invariant is 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(f)\coloneqq\int_{\partial P}f\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}f\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x,\ \text{for convex }f:P\rightarrow\mathbb{R},
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 is the unique affine function such that 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(h)=\int_{\partial P}h\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}h\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x=0,\ \text{for all affine function }h.
\]

\end_inset

Equivalently,
 take 
\begin_inset Formula $h=1,x_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 satisfies linear system:
 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int_{P}\ell_{P}=\left|\partial P\right|_{\mathrm{d}\sigma},\int_{P}x_{i}\ell_{P}=\int_{\partial P}x_{i}\mathrm{d}\sigma,\ i=1,\dots,n.
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Definition
We say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-semistable if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)\geq0$
\end_inset

 for all 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

 is the space of continuous functions on 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

.
 Otherwise,
 if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)<0$
\end_inset

 for some 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 we say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Fact
\begin_inset Argument 1
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Donaldson
\end_layout

\end_inset

 when 
\begin_inset Formula $n=2$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable if and only if there is a simple convex function of the form 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
g=\max\left\{ ax+by+c,0\right\} 
\]

\end_inset

such that 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(g)<0$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Goal:
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
1.
 compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 precisely.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
2.
 develop an algorithm to test the un-stability of polygons using the fact of Donaldson.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
3.
 前面是给定多面体，
探测它是否unstable.
 现在我想搜索2维的relative K-unstable 格点多面体.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
输入参数：
顶点个数
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

,
 正整数
\begin_inset Formula $N$
\end_inset

约束法向量的复杂度，

\begin_inset Formula $M$
\end_inset

约束边长。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
用逐步选取边向量和边长的方法来生成
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

。
记 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathcal{P}_{N}=\left\{ (a,b)\in\mathbb{Z}^{2}\mid\gcd\left(a,b\right)=1,(a,b)\neq(0,0),\left|a\right|\le N,\left|b\right|\le N\right\} 
\]

\end_inset

为非零primitive integer vectors构成的集合。
按如下方式依次选取
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

个顶点。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
取第一个顶点
\begin_inset Formula $v_{1}=(0,0)$
\end_inset

,
 第一个方向
\begin_inset Formula $p_{1}=(1,0)$
\end_inset

。
 选正整数步长
\begin_inset Formula $k_{1}\le M$
\end_inset

,
 得到第2个顶点
\begin_inset Formula $v_{2}=v_{1}+k_{1}p_{1}$
\end_inset

。
选第二个方向
\begin_inset Formula $p_{2}\in\mathcal{P}_{N}$
\end_inset

使得
\begin_inset Formula $p_{1}$
\end_inset

到
\begin_inset Formula $p_{2}$
\end_inset

的逆时针夹角介于
\begin_inset Formula $0$
\end_inset

到
\begin_inset Formula $\pi$
\end_inset

之间。
选正整数步长
\begin_inset Formula $k_{2}\le M$
\end_inset

,
 得到第3个顶点
\begin_inset Formula $v_{3}=v_{2}+k_{2}p_{2}$
\end_inset

。
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
一般地，
 从顶点
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}$
\end_inset

 (
\begin_inset Formula $i\le d-1$
\end_inset

)开始，
 选方向
\begin_inset Formula $p_{i}\in\mathcal{P}_{N}$
\end_inset

使得
\begin_inset Formula $p_{i-1}$
\end_inset

到
\begin_inset Formula $p_{i}$
\end_inset

的逆时针夹角介于
\begin_inset Formula $0$
\end_inset

到
\begin_inset Formula $\pi$
\end_inset

之间。
选正整数步长
\begin_inset Formula $k_{i}\le M$
\end_inset

,
 使得下一个顶点
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i+1}=v_{i}+k_{i}p_{i}$
\end_inset

的第二分量大于0 (即
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i+1}$
\end_inset

在上半平面中)。
如此下去，
直到得到
\begin_inset Formula $v_{d}$
\end_inset

（位于上半平面）。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
连接
\begin_inset Formula $v_{d}$
\end_inset

和
\begin_inset Formula $v_{1}$
\end_inset

得到一个位于上半平面的整点多边形。
然后用现成的Donaldson程序探测其非稳定性.
 注意边
\begin_inset Formula $\overline{v_{i}v_{i+1}}$
\end_inset

的
\begin_inset Formula $d\sigma$
\end_inset

测度为
\begin_inset Formula $k_{i}$
\end_inset

。
 边
\begin_inset Formula $\overline{v_{d}v_{1}}$
\end_inset

的步长没有被
\begin_inset Formula $M$
\end_inset

约束。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
冗余：
注意
\begin_inset Formula $(k_{1},\dots,k_{d-1})$
\end_inset

与
\begin_inset Formula $(lk_{1},\dots,lk_{d-1})$
\end_inset

可视为等价，
因为它们给出的多边形相似。
搜索中记录Donaldson检测过的
\begin_inset Formula $(k_{1},\dots,k_{d-1})$
\end_inset

。
一旦发现新的
\begin_inset Formula $(k_{1},\dots,k_{d-1})$
\end_inset

向量不是primitive的，
就查看约去公因子后的向量是否已经检测过，
避免重复Donaldson检测。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
注意根据handoff的记录,
 5边形没有找到unstable例子,
 所以
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

至少取6.
 根据K-stability-toric-literature.md,
 Wang–Zhou发现有unstable的9边形存在.
 
\end_layout

